    card title "I want"

A: How do you tell someone in Russian what you want, and what you don't?
    draw tom tom_name masha masha_name

A: Masha's café question is the place to start.
    draw hook

B: In the café lesson I asked you что вы хоти́те: what would you like? Хоти́те is want, and today Tom answers with it.
    highlight hook part хоти́те color #c9871a effect underline

    erase hook

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

A: Я хочу́ суп: I want soup. Хочу́ is I want, and the thing simply follows it.
    highlight talk_2_words part хочу́ color #c9871a

B: Then I asked чай и́ли ко́фе: и́ли means or, so, tea or coffee?
    highlight talk_3_words part или color #c9871a

A: And I said я не хочу́ чай. Не means not: I don't want tea.
    highlight talk_4_words part ^не$ color #c9871a

    erase talk

    hide speakers

A: Now the verb itself. About myself, I say я хочу́, ending in у.
    draw p_ya v_ya g_ya

B: To a friend, ты хо́чешь, ending in ешь.
    draw p_ty v_ty g_ty

A: About Masha, она́ хо́чет, she wants, ending in ет; and about a man, он хо́чет.
    draw p_on v_on g_on

B: And to a customer, вы хоти́те: my café question.
    draw p_vy v_vy g_vy

B: Its те is the вы ending you know from здра́вствуйте.
    highlight v_vy part те$ color #c9871a

    erase g_ya g_ty g_on g_vy

A: Set it beside говорю́ from lesson seven.
    draw c_ya c_ty c_on c_vy

A: The endings nearly match: у and ю, ешь and ишь, ет and ит.
    draw eq_ya eq_ty eq_on

A: And for вы, ите twice: exactly the same.
    draw eq_vy

B: But the middle moves: хоч for я, ты and он…
    highlight v_ya v_ty v_on part ч color #d0865f effect pulse

B: …then хот for вы. Говорю́ never does that, so learn these four by ear.
    highlight v_vy part т color #d0865f effect pulse

    hide table govcol

B: Now не. Я хочу́ чай: I want tea.
    draw s_yes

    draw s_no

B: Put не just before the verb: я не хочу́ чай, I don't want tea.
    highlight s_no part ^не$ color #c9871a

    erase s_yes s_no

A: And for a choice, и́ли: чай и́ли ко́фе? Careful: и, from lesson five's story, means and.
    draw i_tea i_coffee s_or

    erase orstrip

B: Now the café's closed, and Tom and I are friends, so it's ты.
    show speakers

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

    draw i_cat_s

    draw talk2

    erase talk2

    erase i_cat_s

    hide speakers

A: The cat is он, so кот хо́чет. Tea or coffee? Neither: milk for both of them.
    draw i_cat i_milk s_cat

    erase i_cat i_milk s_cat

    draw match

    ask "Match each person to the verb." on match store m reveal_style beside stage own test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Я хочу́, ты хо́чешь, он хо́чет, вы хоти́те.
        wrong: You got {m} on the first try.

    erase match

    draw q_dad

    quiz "Tom says about his dad: Па́па … чай. Which word fills the gap?" reveal.text "Па́па хо́чет чай." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 330 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Па́па is он, and он takes the ending ет.
        wrong: Tom is talking about his dad, not to him: which row is он?
        * хочу́
        * хо́чешь
        + хо́чет

    erase q_dad reveal_1_stamp

    draw q_soup

    ask "Say you don't want soup: Я … хочу́ суп. Type the missing word." answer ["не"] store a3 default не reveal.text "Я не хочу́ суп." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 330 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Не, right before the verb: I don't want soup.
        wrong: Two letters, and it goes just before хочу́.

    erase q_soup a3_stamp

    draw i_tea i_coffee parallel true

    quiz "Masha offers you a choice: Чай … ко́фе? Which word fills the gap?" reveal.text "Чай и́ли ко́фе?" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 420 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Tea or coffee: a choice. With и she'd be offering both.
        wrong: She wants you to pick one of the two.
        * и
        + и́ли
        * не

    erase reveal_3_stamp i_tea i_coffee

    draw q_coffee

    ask "Masha asks: Что вы хоти́те? Finish your answer: Я … ко́фе. Type the verb." answer ["хочу"] store a5 default хочу reveal.text "Я хочу́ ко́фе." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 330 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Я хочу́ ко́фе: I want coffee.
        wrong: It's the я form: it ends in у.

    erase q_coffee a5_stamp

    show table

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

    hide table

A: So: я хочу́, plus the thing you want.
    draw r1

A: Не before the verb says what you don't.
    draw r2

A: And и́ли offers a choice.
    draw r3

    erase recap

B: And my café question works with ты too.
    show speakers

    draw bye

    draw bye

